        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "<div>Hi <span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\">Madisen. </span>\n</div><div>I hope you are doing well.<br><br>This is Maryam from the Avicenna Research team and I am reaching out to see if you have had a chance to review the quote that my colleague, Sara, sent you.<br>I would appreciate it if you could give me an update on the status of your project. <br><br>your provided information will help us to plan the next steps more accordingly.<br><br>Looking forward to hearing from you soon.<br><br>Best,<br>Maryam<br><br><br><br>\n</div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\">On Saturday, October 19, 2024 at 4:03:54 AM, Sara Farnya wrote:<br><br><div>Hi <span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\">Madisen</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\">,</span>\n</div>\n<div><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\">I hope you are doing well. Sorry for the delayed response.</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\"><br></span></div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">My name is Sara from Avicenna. </span><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\">Thank you for reaching out and </span>sharing your information with us.<span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\"> We're glad to hear from you again and appreciate your interest in using our EMA services for your dissertation study.</span>\n</div>\n<div><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\"><br></span></div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">Regarding the cost estimation</span>, the total licensing fee to collect survey responses (EMA data) from up to 300 participants for the duration of 7 days over 1.5 years will be CAD 1,170.00 (~ USD 847.06). We have absolutely no limitations on the number of questions in a survey and the number of surveys within a day. Let me know if this sounds good to you and I'll share more details about the next steps with you.</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>For further questions, please don't hesitate to contact me. O<span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\">ur calendar is also shared</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\"> </span><a href=\"https://calendar.app.google/k3qhxemdRRqxz5bT6\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://calendar.app.google/k3qhxemdRRqxz5bT6\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> <span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\">just in case.</span>\n</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>Best,</div>\n<div><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\">Sara</span></div>\n<div data-signature=\"true\" data-signature-id=\"4\">--<br>Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)<br><div><div>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</div></div>\n<div>Email: sales@avicennaresearch.com - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br>--</div>\n</div>\n<br>\n</blockquote></div><div><br></div>",
