        "message_id_md5": "1d7184f959da5486443583177e4e6fb3",
        "in_reply_to": null,
        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "<div>Good morning, Sara,</div><div> </div><div>I hope all is well. Is it possible for you to provide a PDF cost estimate for 400 participants for the duration of 7 days over 1.5 years? I would like to submit it with my NIH grant application.</div><div> </div><div>Warm regards,</div><div>Madisen</div><div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<span style=\" background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Madisen Russell, M.S. </span><span style=\" background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(she/her)</span>\n</div>\n<div style=\" color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Doctoral Student, Clinical Psychology</div>\n<div>\n<span style=\" color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Cognition, Language, and Affect in Serious Psychopathology (CLASP) Lab</span><span><br>\n</span><span style=\" color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Indiana University Indianapolis</span>\n</div>\n<div style=\" color: rgb(12, 100, 192);\">\n<a href=\"mailto:%20madtruss@iu.edu\" title=\"mailto: madtruss@iu.edu\">madtruss@iu.edu</a>\n</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">CONFIDENTIALITY NOTICE: Please note that email is not a secure form of communication. Confidentiality of email messages cannot be assured.</span>\n</div>\n</div><hr>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<b>From:</b> Sara Farnya &lt;sales@avicennaresearch.com&gt;<br>\n<b>Sent:</b> Friday, October 18, 2024 8:33 PM<br>\n<b>To:</b> Russell, Madisen Taylor &lt;madtruss@iu.edu&gt;<br>\n<b>Subject:</b> [External] Quote Request <div> </div>\n</div><div>\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"left\" style=\"background:revert!important; border:revert!important; color:revert!important; font-size:revert!important; margin:revert!important; padding:revert!important; text-align:revert!important; vertical-align:revert!important; width:revert!important; border:0!important; width:100%!important; border-collapse:seperate!important; border-spacing:0px 0px!important;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"background:revert!important; border:revert!important; color:revert!important; font-size:revert!important; margin:revert!important; padding:revert!important; text-align:revert!important; vertical-align:revert!important; width:revert!important;\">\n<td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background:revert!important; border:revert!important; color:revert!important; font-size:revert!important; margin:revert!important; padding:revert!important; text-align:revert!important; vertical-align:revert!important; width:revert!important; padding:7px 2px 7px 2px!important; background-color:#a6a6a6!important; width:0px!important;\">\n</td>\n<td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background:revert!important; border:revert!important; color:revert!important; font-size:revert!important; margin:revert!important; padding:revert!important; text-align:revert!important; vertical-align:revert!important; width:revert!important; width:100%!important; background-color:#eaeaea!important; padding:7px 5px 7px 15px!important; font-size:12px!important; color:#212121!important; text-align:left!important;\">\n<div style=\" color:revert!important;\"> You don't often get email from sales@avicennaresearch.com. <a href=\"https://aka.ms/LearnAboutSenderIdentification\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://aka.ms/LearnAboutSenderIdentification\" target=\"_blank\"> Learn why this is important</a> </div>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"middle\" align=\"left\" style=\"background:revert!important; border:revert!important; color:revert!important; font-size:revert!important; margin:revert!important; padding:revert!important; text-align:revert!important; vertical-align:revert!important; width:revert!important; width:75px!important; background-color:#eaeaea!important; padding:7px 5px 7px 5px!important; font-size:12px!important; color:#212121!important; text-align:left!important;\">\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div>\n<div>This message was sent from a non-IU address. Please exercise caution when clicking links or opening attachments from external sources.</div>\n<br>\n\n<div>\n<div>Hi Madisen,</div>\n<div><span><br>\n</span></div>\n<div>I hope you are doing well. Sorry for the delayed response.</div>\n<div><span><br>\n</span></div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"background-color:initial;\">My name is Sara from Avicenna. </span>Thank you for reaching out and sharing your information with us. We're glad to hear from you again and appreciate your interest in using our EMA services for your dissertation study. </div>\n<div><span><br>\n</span></div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"background-color:initial;\">Regarding the cost estimation</span>, the total licensing fee to collect survey responses (EMA data) from up to 300 participants for the duration of 7 days over 1.5 years will be CAD 1,170.00 (~ USD 847.06). We have absolutely no limitations on the number of questions in a survey and the number of surveys within a day. Let me know if this sounds good to you and I'll share more details about the next steps with you.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>For further questions, please don't hesitate to contact me. Our calendar is also shared <a href=\"https://calendar.app.google/k3qhxemdRRqxz5bT6\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://calendar.app.google/k3qhxemdRRqxz5bT6\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> just in case. </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Best,</div>\n<div>Sara</div>\n<div data-signature=\"true\" data-signature-id=\"4\">--<br> Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)<br>\n<div>\n<div>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</div>\n</div>\n<div>Email: sales@avicennaresearch.com - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"> https://avicennaresearch.com</a><span class=\"js-signatureMarker\"></span><br> --</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
