        "body": "<div>Hi <span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">Madisen,<br>Hope you are doing well.<br><br>Thanks for reaching out. Attached is estimate #1178 based on the information that you have provided. Kindly review it and let me know if you need any further assistance.<br><br>Looking forward to hearing good news on your grant application.<br><br>Best,<br>Maryam</span>\n</div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\">On Thursday, November 7, 2024 at 3:51:08 PM, Madisen Taylor Russell wrote:<br><br>madtruss@iu.edu<br>\n</blockquote></div><div><br></div><br><br><div data-signature=\"true\" data-signature-id=\"4\">--<br>Avicenna Research Inc.<br><div><div>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</div></div>\n<div>Email: sales@avicennaresearch.com - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br>--</div>\n</div>",
