        "message_id": "<BYAPR08MB4135A6AC7E0ADE7FC7265359A7FD2@BYAPR08MB4135.namprd08.prod.outlook.com>",
        "message_id_md5": "f4b6f062a7af384a5f14e2dcff3932a7",
        "in_reply_to": null,
        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "<div>Good morning, Maryam,</div><div> </div><div>I won't have word on whether the grant is approved or not until late March at the earliest. I will reach out when I know!</div><div> </div><div>Thanks for checking in.</div><div> </div><div>Best,</div><div>Madisen</div><div> </div><div>\n<div>\n<span style=\" background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Madisen Russell, M.S. </span><span style=\" background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(she/her)</span>\n</div>\n<div style=\" color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Doctoral Student, Clinical Psychology</div>\n<div>\n<span style=\" color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Cognition, Language, and Affect in Serious Psychopathology (CLASP) Lab</span><span><br>\n</span><span style=\" color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Indiana University Indianapolis</span>\n</div>\n<div style=\" color: rgb(12, 100, 192);\">\n<a href=\"mailto:%20madtruss@iu.edu\" title=\"mailto: madtruss@iu.edu\">madtruss@iu.edu</a>\n</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">CONFIDENTIALITY NOTICE: Please note that email is not a secure form of communication. Confidentiality of email messages cannot be assured.</span>\n</div>\n</div><hr>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<b>From:</b> Maryam Hashemian &lt;sales@avicennaresearch.com&gt;<br>\n<b>Sent:</b> Wednesday, February 5, 2025 4:15 PM<br>\n<b>To:</b> Russell, Madisen Taylor &lt;madtruss@iu.edu&gt;<br>\n<b>Subject:</b> [External] RE: Quote Request <div> </div>\n</div><div>\n<div>This message was sent from a non-IU address. Please exercise caution when clicking links or opening attachments from external sources.</div>\n<br>\n\n<div>\n<div>Hi Madisen,</div>\n<div>It's been a while since our last contact. I hope all is well with you.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>I am writing to follow up if there have been any updates regarding the funding application.<br>\n<div>Any update would be greatly appreciated and your information would help us to take the next steps accordingly.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Meanwhile, please do not hesitate to contact me if you need any assistance.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Looking forward to hearing from you soon.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Best,<br> Maryam</div>\n<br>\n</div>\n<div>\n<blockquote type=\"cite\"> On Thursday, November 7, 2024 at 4:52:50 PM, Maryam Hashemian wrote:<br>\n<br>\n<div>Hi <span style=\"background-color:initial;\">Madisen,<br> Hope you are doing well.<br>\n<br> Thanks for reaching out. Attached is estimate #1178 based on the information that you have provided. Kindly review it and let me know if you need any further assistance.<br>\n<br> Looking forward to hearing good news on your grant application.<br>\n<br> Best,<br> Maryam</span> </div>\n<div>\n<blockquote type=\"cite\"> On Thursday, November 7, 2024 at 3:51:08 PM, Madisen Taylor Russell wrote:<br>\n<br> madtruss@iu.edu<br>\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n<div> </div>\n<br>\n<br>\n<div data-signature=\"true\" data-signature-id=\"4\">--<br> Avicenna Research Inc.<br>\n<div>\n<div>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</div>\n</div>\n<div>Email: sales@avicennaresearch.com - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"> https://avicennaresearch.com</a><span class=\"js-signatureMarker\"></span><br> --</div>\n</div>\n<br>\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n<div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>",
